            <Placemark id="6">
                <name>Cuming County Courthouse (Cuming County, NE) (West Point, NE)</name>
                <description>Bid Requests | has contact: Yes
seeking roofer |  | 2026-10-16 (published; re-runs 10/23)
Invitation to bid: removal and full roof replacement of the Cuming County Courthouse, 200 S. Lincoln St. Sealed bids due Tue Nov 10, 2026 10:30 AM (opened 10:45 AM); award Nov 24; completion desired by Apr 30, 2027. 5% bid bond/certified check; bidder must be membrane-manufacturer certified, 15+ yrs in business, proof of 1,000,000 sq low-slope membrane installed under warranty, no subcontracted labor. Documents at County Clerk, Room 100.
Contact: Brian Fischer, Grounds and Building Manager (project questions; mobile redacted on notice); County Clerk Addisen Johnson (bid documents)
Phone: (402) 372-6002 (County Clerk)
Email: clerk@cumingcounty.ne.gov
Website: https://cumingcountyne.gov
Confidence: confirmed
Source: https://www.noticeregistry.com/nebraska/notice/bid-notice-west-point-768623
~57 mi from Omaha</description>
